Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.26,0:00:05.26,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:05.78,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.906,327.273)\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,3660,4780)}Episode 45
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:05.78,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.906,518.182)\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,3660,4780)}Angering Zhōu Yú Thrice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:37.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(301.578,492.273)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3660,3980)}Zhōu Yú\NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:13.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 15th year of the Jian'an era (early 210 CE),
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:16.84,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu led troops to pursue and kill Liu Bei and Lady Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:19.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,but Zhuge Liang's ambush forced him into flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:25.60,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu's anger was so intense that his arrow wound reopened. He had to return to Chaisang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:30.32,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He petitioned Sun Quan, requesting he send an army to avenge his defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, drink this while it is still hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My stamina is not as it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My {\i1}Yangzi River Song{\i0} is still unfinished,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(898.885,350.65)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2460,2780)}Xiao Qiáo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but this wound prevents me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:01:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You are still healing, \Nwhy must you play such a morose melody?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}My heart feels shame for this last defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}As I rest, I can only think of the hardships of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}It is like the ever-flowing river.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.16,0:01:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Though its ambition is to flow east into the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}it courses through an arduous route.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}But... the river flows into the sea eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}In contrast, a man's ambitions are often hard to fulfill,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}remaining a regret until their death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I can understand some of your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Your abilities are without equal and you serve a wise lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}All in achieving the goal of unifying the country, truly the greatest of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}But for small brooks to reach \Nthe river is already a difficult task.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}When it goes and finally merges into the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}its sense of insignificance redoubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Your words are as true as metal and stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}They have really comforted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I remember that you once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}"During the day, I listen to my {\i1}qin-{\i0}zither;"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}"during the night, I read with a beauty."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}"This is my life's ultimate desire."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was but the dream of a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang and Liu Bei \Nhave cheated us for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why has our liege not sent \Nan army to take Jing Province yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord read your memorial and was about to send reinforcements to attack Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but he worried about Cao Cao exploiting a fallout between the Sun and Liu to take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jing Province will have to wait for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:04:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,For each day Jing-Xiang eludes our Eastern Wu, \Neach day I grow restless!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:04:02.16,Note (Potential style?),NTP,0,0,0,,Note: Jīng-Xiāng (荆襄) aka. Jing Province and Xiangyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:07.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(468.952,455.065)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3740,4100)}Zhāng Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐbù
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That is why our liege asked me to bring this medicine to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}It will calm your inflammation and ease your insides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Our lord has sent an envoy to Xuchang,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}petitioning for Liu Bei to be \Nthe Lord-Potentate of Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}sowing dissension and strife between the Cao and Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Then we of Eastern Wu\N can seize the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But who has our liege sent as the envoy to Xudu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huá Xīn, Huá Zǐyú!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:59.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 15th year of the Jian'an era, the Spring of 210,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:03.37,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan sent Hua Xin as an envoy to the capital of Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:05.33,Thinking,,0,0,0,,where he requested to meet with Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:10.76,Thinking,,0,0,0,,At the time, Cao Cao was in Ye Commandery in a grand assembly of civil and military officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:14.92,Thinking,,0,0,0,,performing the inauguration ceremony of the Bronze Sparrow Terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:28.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(958.1,472.728)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2900,3260)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Today's archery contest shall be held \Nbetween two teams of generals:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}the red cloaks, worn by those of the Cao family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}and the green cloaks, worn by the other generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Each shall have good bows and arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}There is a brocade robe \Nfrom the Western Riverlands of Shǔ,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:48.24,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Shǔ (AKA. modern day Sichuan Province) was famous for \Nits beautiful silks and brocade in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}hanging upon that willow tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}A target is set below the robe, \Nand the range is a hundred paces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Here is a command from the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Whoever hits the red center of the target
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}shall win the red robe on the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Those who cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}shall be punished by drinking a cup of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}According to custom and your rank, \Nyou should wear red today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Why did you instead dress in green, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}What do you think it means, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}I am but of meager ability and lack knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}so I wish for the Chancellor to enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}For all my life, the way I employ my people
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}has never been for their clan's prestige,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}but for their true talents and ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}This is why I wore green today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:04.72,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: In history, green was associated with and worn mostly by commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you are truly just and selfless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:17.84,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Truly just and selfless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Witness I, Cao Xiu's, arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(323.678,437.922)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,6900,6260)}Cáo Xiū\NStyled: Wénliè
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:09:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! Young Xiu is truly our family's great stallion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the brocade robe gifted to him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Chancellor, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The robe should belong to outsiders with the best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.60,0:09:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why show bias towards kinsmen? Witness my shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(937.577,478.441)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2220,2570)}Wén Pìng\NStyled: Zhòngyè
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, give me the robe! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:35.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(975.067,486.233)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2860,3180)}Cáo Hóng\NStyled: Zǐlián
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenlie won it first! Why do you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me solve this for them with my arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cao has extraordinary skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How accurate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A mediocre shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:58.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.956,461.299)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2460,2780)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:09:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me shoot away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That red cloak ought to be my reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:24.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(853.225,484.676)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3540,3820)}Xiàhóu Yuān\NStyled: Miàocái
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting from the top of one's head, \Nhow is that impressive? Watch me shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that arrow get that brocade robe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All the generals with such splendid skill \Nshall each be gifted Shu brocades!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}"As lowly as a blade of grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}he became a gale, sweeping across creation."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}"Rising above slander and insult,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}he forged a new way forward in troubled times."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}"Only Heaven and Earth are without limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}how I wish for good fortune to be as well!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}"We can only spit out our food and wring our hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}who from history can compare to him?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}All of your writings are beyond compare,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}blossoms come out of your brush!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}"Who can compare to him?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}You give me too much praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I was nothing but a crude and simple man
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}nominated in xiaolian to serve the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:22.24,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: {\i1}Xiàolián{\i0} (孝廉) refers to one of the steps of Han Dynasty's civil examination, an early precursor to the later Imperial Examination system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Later on, the realm fell to chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}I built a retreat in my hometown, {\bord11.909}where I wished to live in peace from the chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}to read in spring and summer,\N and hunt in autumn and winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}passing my days, waiting for peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Yet, the court assigned me to serve as Department Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Thus, I forsook my life of luxury,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}all to serve our nation, \Npurging all rebels and outlaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I had but one wish in the past;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}it was for my epitaph to read:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}"Here lies the former General-Who-Subdues-the-West, Marquis Cao."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}However, since then I have washed away the Yellow Turbans,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}suppressed Dong Zhuo, eliminated Yuan Shu,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}defeated Lü Bu, wiped out Yuan Shao, and pacified Liu Biao,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}bringing peace and returning might to the Four Seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Now that I am Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}I have reached the highest step on the ladder of offices.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}What greater ambition would I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Suppose the nation did not have me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}who knows how many would declare themselves kings and emperors?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Many see my power with delusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}they suspect me of ill intent, but they are in great err!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I am demanded to cede my armies,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}settle with a fief and return to the court. \NBut this cannot be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}For I fear what those with true ill intent can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}If I fall, the empire will fall also, \Nthrowing all back to ruin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}How can I, for the sake of those baseless delusions, bring upon that ruin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:16:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}All my heart's work, might be unknown to you, fellow sirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Who could know my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Who can know my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Who can know my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Chancellor's nobility is peerless \Nto all but Yi Yin and the Duke of Zhou!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:43.00,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Yi Yin and the Duke of Zhou helped their sovereigns maintain stability for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring pen and paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I will write my most honest words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the nine commanderies of the Han River have been taken over by Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan has married his younger sister to Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sent Hua Xin here with a petition...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,that Liu Bei be made \N{\i1}Lord Potentate of Jing Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Your Excellency has stormed through the struggle of flying horses, faced slings and raining arrows,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}and never once have you lost your nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}But when you heard that Liu Bei gained Jing Province, what shocked you so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:47.60,That one frame,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3740,4100)\pos(977.6,372.4)}程昱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:47.60,That one frame,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3740,4100)\pos(1043.2,444.4)}“字 仲德”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:46.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1038.4,479.6)}Chéng Yù \NStyled:\N Zhòngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Liu Bei is a dragon amongst men.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}All his life, he had never reached water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Now that he has Jing Province, \Nit is as if a dragon entered the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:59.24,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: In Chinese myth, dragons are closely associated with the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}How can I keep my composure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Does Your Excellency know why Hua Xin came?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Sun Quan wanted to send his troops against Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}but feared you would \Ntake advantage and march south.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Thus, he petitioned for Liu Bei to lord over Jing Province, in order to ease Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}At the same time, he wants you to believe that\N their alliance is secure to limit your options.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I have a plan to make them fight each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.16,0:18:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Your Excellency then can make plans against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Your Excellency should petition for Zhou Yu to be Administrator of Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}These two places are both within Liu Bei's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:19:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Zhou Yu would lead forces there to claim them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Once these two sides start fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}would Your Excellency not be \Nthe fisherman who reaps the benefits?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:08.56,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: A Chinese idiom (渔翁之利). In the fight between the snipe and the clam, the fisherman has the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongde, your words...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,speaks my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Zhou Yu, adept in both civil and military matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}a scholar's general.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.44,0:19:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}We hereby appoint him as Administrator of Nan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}and Cheng Pu as Administrator of Jiangxia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our liege petitioned for\N Liu Bei to govern Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to force Cao Cao to see the unity of the two, so that he would not dare act.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,However, now he appointed you as \NAdministrator of Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He is thus provoking the Sun-Liu alliance,\N to fight each other to reap the gains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Though what you said makes sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:20:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we cannot sit and watch Jing-Xiang be stolen away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then send me there to demand \NJing Province back, to avert a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:12.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(881.343,441.041)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3140,3540)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan has petitioned for you \Nto be Lord of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet Cao Cao made Zhou Yu \Nthe Administrator of Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The former fears Cao Cao will exploit the friction to invade,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the latter wishes to provoke a fight between our alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He would take advantage from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu Zijing has come here for the purpose of demanding Jing Province back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:39.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(992.25,489.352)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3250,3620)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing is a loyal and generous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He argued for our protection, so Sun Quan and Zhou Yu blamed him for their loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If we make excuses while he demands Jing Province back,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I dread letting him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.04,0:21:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as Zijing brings up Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,burst into tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When you cry to the point of grief, I will come to resolve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite Master Lu in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for such respect! Take a seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you are son-in-law to Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you are also my superior.\N How could I dare take a seat first?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, we are old friends! Must you be like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.44,0:21:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,On the orders of the Marquis of Wu,\N I came here to talk about Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, in front of the Marquis of Wu, I advocated
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to lend Jing Province as a\N temporary residence for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it has been a long time since your promise, \Nand it has not been returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.12,0:22:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that our two families are married,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,consider that and return the land of Jing-Xiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.00,0:22:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, why are you... why are you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, do you know why my lord is crying so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.88,0:23:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously, when my liege borrowed Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,he made a promise that if he took the \NWestern Riverlands, he would return Jing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you think about it, Liu Zhang \Nof Yi Province is his younger kinsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Both share the Han Dynasty's Liu surname!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If he raises troops to steal his cities, he fears people will condemn him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the Western Riverlands, he would return Jing,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but where would our haven be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.84,0:23:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If he cannot return it,\N then as our families are married,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,when making this decision, \Nhow could he not feel sorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:24:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, do not be so upset! Kongming and I are debating a long-term strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.08,0:24:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please Zijing, go back to the Marquis of Wu for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.56,0:24:14.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,For his trouble, I earnestly apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.88,0:24:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When you return, please give us more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the Marquis of Wu does not agree, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.20,0:24:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu has married his sister to the Imperial Uncle. How can he not agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you can persuade him when you return.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.68,0:24:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Another of Zhuge Liang's plots!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.88,0:24:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not know that Liu Bei\N relied on Liu Biao in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:25:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He has always intended annexation. Would he not do the same to Liu Zhang of the west?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.32,0:25:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we have come to this point, \Nhow should we deal with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.56,0:25:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan, one that even Zhuge Liang can't beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.32,0:25:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear your plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, do not meet with the Marquis of Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.48,0:25:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to Jing Province and tell Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.96,0:25:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that ever since the Sun and Liu have married, they are one family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.56,0:25:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If he cannot take the Riverlands, I will lead troops to take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.16,0:25:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When I get it, I will trade it for Jing Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Western Riverlands are too far away. Taking it will not be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not. Do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.40,0:25:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, you are a loyal and generous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.28,0:25:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I will go\N take the Western Riverlands for a trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:26:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That is just my pretext to throw them off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,When I pass through Jing Province,\N I will ask them for resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.40,0:26:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei will leave the city to supply our army, and then we can kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.52,0:26:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will get back Jing Province, take revenge, and solve your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.64,0:26:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, do not be hesitant! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.08,0:26:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu is aware of your predicament,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.12,0:26:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so he ordered Commander Zhou Yu to raise troops
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to help you take the Western Riverlands \Nwhile you give back Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.08,0:26:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, the Western Riverlands are your dowry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rarely does the Marquis of Wu act so kindly!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.24,0:26:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all because of your kind words, Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.84,0:26:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I ask what we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.32,0:27:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When our army passes by, you only need to supply a small amount of money and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.48,0:27:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, worry not. When your mighty army comes, we shall support you from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.96,0:27:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.12,0:27:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.76,0:27:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909\pos(640,670)}What a trifling scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909\pos(640,670)}They want to "Borrow Roads to Destroy Guo."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:39.24,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: An idiom referring to the Spring and Autumn era, when Jin State obtained rights from Guó State(虢) to use its roads on a campaign. Jin used them to conquer Guo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.48,0:27:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909)}The pretext is the western lands, \Nbut their goal is Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.12,0:27:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909\pos(640,670)}If you go out to greet their army,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.24,0:27:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909\pos(640,670)}they will seize you and attack the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.48,0:27:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How should we deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.40,0:27:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord can remain calm. Just make \Npreparations and wait for Zhou Yu to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.04,0:27:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does not die, then it will ravage his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.28,0:28:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has fallen to my plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, I still have some concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.96,0:28:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we could take back Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.52,0:28:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just fear that the Sun-Liu alliance will thus cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.80,0:28:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, Eastern Wu will be alone in facing the powerful north.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask that you reconsider this thrice!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the nine commanderies of the Han River are ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.04,0:28:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,that will be enough to resist Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.64,0:28:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Without this move, would Liu Bei \Nreturn Jing of his own accord?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.92,0:28:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When we march, Gan Ning shall be the vanguard;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ling Tong and Lü Meng shall be the rearguard;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.40,0:28:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, Xu Sheng, and Ding Feng shall lead 50,000 land and naval troops towards Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You, sir, shall remain to guard Chaisang.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.96,0:29:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You are too trusting and generous.\N I fear you lack resolve against others.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.24,0:29:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall inform the Marquis of Wu, \Nwho will send Cheng Pu to lead an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.40,0:29:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you have made up your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.84,0:29:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall remain in Chaisang and await good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Zijing, you are the friend everyone needs, \Nbut when it comes to imperial ambitions,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.84,0:29:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909\pos(640,670)}one has to put emotions and feelings aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, there are people welcoming us over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.68,0:29:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How surprising!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.76,0:29:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even Zhuge Liang could fall for my ploy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Uncle has sent me to pay respects to you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.40,0:30:23.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(290.874,447.273)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2900,3320)}Mí Zhú\NStyled: Zǐzhòng
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.84,0:30:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How is your army?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.36,0:30:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.96,0:30:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Imperial Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.64,0:30:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He is waiting outside the gates of Jing Province to toast with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.20,0:30:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.88,0:30:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Inform the Imperial Uncle that I am sending troops on an expedition today for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.68,0:30:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,To show respect for your army, they will not lead this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.88,0:30:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, don't worry! I will go report back to my liege and the Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.64,0:30:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I would not dare be negligent!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.68,0:31:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, we are just over 10 {\i1}li{\i0} from Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.28,0:31:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However, no one has greeted us yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.00,0:31:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The city gates are closed. There are only \Ntwo white flags above the city, with no one there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Meng?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.60,0:31:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.64,0:31:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Ling Tong will lead several units \Nto station along the river banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.76,0:31:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead the generals to Jing Province\N just in case something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.25,0:31:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go tell the army to board boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.66,0:31:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.80,0:31:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us march!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.83,0:31:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Feng, call them to open the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.52,0:31:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.24,0:32:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.12,0:32:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.32,0:32:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who calls to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.48,0:32:20.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.992,456.623)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3060,3540)}Dìng Fèng\NStyled: Chéngyuān
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.32,0:32:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ding Feng of Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.16,0:32:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander Zhou Yu is here! \NHurry and let us through to welcome him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.68,0:32:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,For what reason have you come here, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.88,0:32:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zilong, I am substituting\N your lord in taking the Riverlands!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.24,0:32:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not open the gates for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.28,0:32:45.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.992,456.623)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2700,3100)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.12,0:32:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Strategos Zhuge knew your \N"Borrowing Roads to Destroy Guo" ploy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.56,0:32:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so he sent me to guard this city!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.52,0:32:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My liege asked me to tell you such!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.36,0:32:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If Eastern Wu aided in acquiring the Western Lands, \Nhe would've gladly handed over Jing Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.72,0:32:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei... you wretched baseborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.92,0:33:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, do be patient!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.72,0:33:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Strategos knows you are proficient in music,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.46,0:33:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so he had me prepare a group \Nof musicians to perform a song for you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.12,0:33:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,titled "Returning in Triumph"!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.10,0:33:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, please listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.24,0:33:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Perform it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.48,0:33:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.12,0:33:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.32,0:33:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.32,0:33:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Armies from all four roads of Jing are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.57,0:33:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu left Jiangling; Zhang Fei left Zigui; \NHuang Zhong left Gong'an; Wei Yan left Canling!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.94,0:33:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know their strength! \NThe shouts of "kill" shake the land!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.69,0:34:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They boom that they will \N"capture alive"..."capture alive"...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.38,0:34:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.00,0:34:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"Capture Zhou Yu alive!"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.48,0:34:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.64,0:34:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture Zhou Yu alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.40,0:34:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That Peasant Zhuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.68,0:34:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander! Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.76,0:35:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is playing my {\i1}Yangzi River Song?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.88,0:35:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,On the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.20,0:35:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,who is it that zithers?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.00,0:35:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know \Nhow to play my {\i1}Yangzi River Song?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909\pos(640,670)}I admired your perfect melody, Gongjin,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.04,0:35:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}thus I obtained it at a great cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.96,0:35:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I have cherished it ever since,\N and I play it from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I am moved by the deep meanings within the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.24,0:36:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}How can people not lament for a great hero on such an arduous road?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.16,0:36:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Chief Commander, you are a true hero of our time,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.92,0:36:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}a splendid figure without equal!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.88,0:36:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I believe that after the Battle of Chibi,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.68,0:36:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}the order of three kingdoms coexisting has been established.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.28,0:36:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Wèi is strong, whilst the Sun \Nand Liu are weak. This is the reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.28,0:36:30.84,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Wèi (魏) is the region named after the city and state of Wei of the Zhou Dynasty, corresponding to parts of modern-day Henan, Hebei, Shanxi, and Shandong. Cao Cao was named the Duke, later Prince, of Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.40,0:36:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}If we join our forces together against lands of Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.08,0:36:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}we achieve the great reunion of the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.72,0:36:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Yet with your northern borders still in turbulence,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.68,0:36:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}you endanger Wu by raising arms against my lord by your accord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.76,0:36:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Are you not aware Cao Cao has,\N since his loss at Chibi,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.48,0:36:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}harbors vengeance against you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.28,0:36:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Chief Commanderl is an intelligent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.52,0:36:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Please, please ruminate over my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.48,0:36:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Kongming! I know you have an eloquent tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.32,0:37:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}How could I not know of what you speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.32,0:37:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Yet still, you and Liu Bei are occupying Eastern Wu's rightful territory and refuse to return it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.44,0:37:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.909}Do you expect our alliance to allow for your fraud and treachery?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.08,0:37:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}As a subject of Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.02,0:37:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}I will do what is needed for its lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.76,0:37:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Today, even if I die at this spot, I will destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.88,0:37:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.72,0:37:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Capture Zhou Yu alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.40,0:38:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord11.909}Capture Zhou Yu alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.71,0:37:54.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(970.381,480)\}Huáng Zhōng\NStyled: Hànshēng
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.68,0:37:56.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(982.878,462.858)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,2220,2570)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.68,0:37:59.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,22220,2570)\pos(305.35,497.142)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.30,0:38:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.50,0:38:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Grant him passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.22,0:38:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,

